  ✓ Reconstruct the Stage 1 rule inventory and independently classify every rule
  ✓ Run Stage 4 preflight and independently verify hashes, bijections, obligations, and target
  ✓ If proof mode, rebuild fresh Lean project and audit target, trust, definitions, and semantics
  → Write complete raw evidence and self-contained REVIEW.md with the required verdict pair
